From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: seilent <github@seilent.net>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 00:02:44 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] drm/panel: novatek-nt36523: Remove the panel when probe fails

nt36523_probe() adds the panel to the registry before it attaches to the
DSI hosts. When an attach fails, for instance with -EPROBE_DEFER, probe
returns with the panel still registered while the memory holding it is
released with the device resources. The next probe attempt then adds
the panel again.

Add the panel with devm_drm_panel_add() so it is removed on every probe
failure and on unbind, and drop the remove callback that only did that.
On unbind the DSI links are now detached before the panel is removed,
the reverse of the probe order.

Fixes: 0993234a0045 ("drm/panel: Add driver for Novatek NT36523")
Signed-off-by: seilent <github@seilent.net>
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-novatek-nt36523.c | 12 +++---------
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-novatek-nt36523.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-novatek-nt36523.c
index 34b9123d3..4fa508f06 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-novatek-nt36523.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-novatek-nt36523.c
@@ -1048,13 +1048,6 @@ static int nt36523_unprepare(struct drm_panel *panel)
 	return 0;
 }
 
-static void nt36523_remove(struct mipi_dsi_device *dsi)
-{
-	struct panel_info *pinfo = mipi_dsi_get_drvdata(dsi);
-
-	drm_panel_remove(&pinfo->panel);
-}
-
 static int nt36523_get_modes(struct drm_panel *panel,
 			       struct drm_connector *connector)
 {
@@ -1226,7 +1219,9 @@ static int nt36523_probe(struct mipi_dsi_device *dsi)
 			return dev_err_probe(dev, ret, "Failed to get backlight\n");
 	}
 
-	drm_panel_add(&pinfo->panel);
+	ret = devm_drm_panel_add(dev, &pinfo->panel);
+	if (ret)
+		return dev_err_probe(dev, ret, "Failed to add panel\n");
 
 	for (i = 0; i < DSI_NUM_MIN + pinfo->desc->is_dual_dsi; i++) {
 		pinfo->dsi[i]->lanes = pinfo->desc->lanes;
@@ -1260,7 +1255,6 @@ MODULE_DEVICE_TABLE(of, nt36523_of_match);
 
 static struct mipi_dsi_driver nt36523_driver = {
 	.probe = nt36523_probe,
-	.remove = nt36523_remove,
 	.driver = {
 		.name = "panel-novatek-nt36523",
 		.of_match_table = nt36523_of_match,
-- 
2.55.0

